---
description: Release, packaging and GitHub publication rules
globs: "VERSION,BUILD_CHANNEL,CHANGELOG.md,README*.md,docs/RELEASE_*.md,scripts/**,.github/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

- `VERSION`, `APP_VERSION`, README artifact names and release notes must agree.
- `BUILD_CHANNEL=INTERN` intentionally blocks public release publication.
- Run `./scripts/check_release.sh` before release packaging/publication.
- Preserve reproducible ZIP/source/DEB/RPM/developer-package and SHA256 generation.
- Require a clean committed worktree and explicit project-owner approval before GitHub publication.
- Do not create a public release from an internal build merely because tests pass.
